      "statement": "The router worker is the instance's public origin: it serves frontend assets, routes /api/* and /blueprint-screenshot/* to the backend and /gatekeeper/<name>/* to gatekeepers by scanning its own GATEKEEPER_* bindings (suffix lowercased, underscores dashed), so installing a connector is purely a redeploy with one more binding, and it doubles as the dev router by falling through to the backend when no ASSETS binding exists.",
